#
# Begin and end of analysis time interval                                       
#
  2016 11 01 00   -(yyyy mm dd hh)- Begin 
  2016 11 01 00   -(yyyy mm dd hh)- End 
#
# Run identifier (CHAR*15)
#
midas           
#
# Comment lines (CHAR*80)
DRAMA
MASTER-based Impact Flux and Damage Assessment
# 
# Target Orbit
#
 7158.00         -(km)-             semi-major Axis
 0.00100         -(-)-              eccentricity
 98.5000         -(deg)-            inclination
  0.0000         -(deg)-            right asc. of asc. node
  0.0000         -(deg)-            argument of perigee
# 
# Satellite properties (if propagation is done, which happens when Begin and end date are different)
# 
  100.00         -(kg)-             spacecraft mass
   1.000         -(m**2)-           cross-sectional area
     2.2         -(-)-              drag coefficient
     1.3         -(-)-              solar radiation pressure coefficient
# 
# Analysis size/mass thresholds
# 
 1.00000e-04 m   -(value (m,kg))-   Lower threshold
 1.00000e+02 m   -(value (m,kg))-   Lower threshold
